        "text_g9trVc": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Vela brings the quiet character of stone into spaces made for everyday living. A palette of White, Cream, Light Grey, Mocha and Charcoal moves from soft, light tones to deeper, more grounded shades, giving you room to create a look that feels distinctly your own. Delicate veining and subtle surface detail lend each colour a sense of depth, while the matt finish offers a gentle backdrop that lets the texture speak.</p><p></p><p>Designed in Italy, the porcelain collection offers a considered starting point for bathrooms, kitchens and living spaces. The 600 × 600mm format creates a balanced rhythm across walls and floors, whether you choose one colour throughout or explore contrasts within the palette. White and Cream invite a lighter mood, Light Grey feels understated, and Mocha and Charcoal bring richness to the scheme. From a fresh renovation to a new home, Vela sets the scene for interiors that feel calm, personal and welcoming.</p>",
